+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/{periodId}/soft-close — soft-close an open period, fixing its due-total and each
+# person's as a close does, while claims dated inside it can still be added, edited, opened, settled and voided. A
+# period not on the sheet, closed or soft-closed already, or a user the close permission does not allow, is a 400 and
+# writes nothing. Responds with the period as stored.
